      <title>A simple explainer of the massive $6.3 billion crypto heist at Binance</title>
      <author>Rafael Nam</author>
      <link>https://www.npr.org/2026/10/31/nx-s1-6024426/binance-crypto-heist-cyber-criminals-north-korea</link>
