kirkland.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7394x5133+0+0/resize/1000/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa3%2Ffb%2F803741c147dba63f83e0697a3078%2Fnc-what-lies-beneath-holly-kirkland.jpg 1000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7394x5133+0+0/resize/1300/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa3%2Ffb%2F803741c147dba63f83e0697a3078%2Fnc-what-lies-beneath-holly-kirkland.jpg 1300w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7394x5133+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa3%2Ffb%2F803741c147dba63f83e0697a3078%2Fnc-what-lies-beneath-holly-kirkland.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7394x5133+0+0/resize/2000/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa3%2Ffb%2F803741c147dba63f83e0697a3078%2Fnc-what-lies-beneath-holly-kirkland.jpg 2000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7394x5133+0+0/resize/2600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa3%2Ffb%2F803741c147dba63f83e0697a3078%2Fnc-what-lies-beneath-holly-kirkland.jpg 2600w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7394x5133+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa3%2Ffb%2F803741c147dba63f83e0697a3078%2Fnc-what-lies-beneath-holly-kirkland.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1300px) 1238px, (min-width: 1025px) calc(100vw - 60px), (min-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 60px), calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7394x5133+0+0/resize/1100/quality/50/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa3%2Ffb%2F803741c147dba63f83e0697a3078%2Fnc-what-lies-beneath-holly-kirkland.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7394x5133+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa3%2Ffb%2F803741c147dba63f83e0697a3078%2Fnc-what-lies-beneath-holly-kirkland.jpg" class="img" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Lesser flamingos fly over Lake Natron, on the Tanzania-Kenya border, where sediment plumes move beneath the water's surface.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Holly Kirkland                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;Another commended entry in the Nature category is &lt;a href="https://exposureoneawards.com/artists/holly-kirkland" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Holly Kirkland's&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt; "What Lies Beneath."' At first glance, it looks like someone splashed ink over a canvas. But what seem like tiny specks of ink are actually lesser flamingos flying over Lake Natron, near the Tanzania–Kenya border. A former kindergarten teacher from Delaware, Kirkland is a self-taught photographer and plans to relocate to Kenya in the year ahead to build a larger body of aerial work.&lt;/p&gt;       &lt;p&gt;This photo wasn't taken with a drone. (Siena does accept other aerial photography entries in the drone category). Kirkland took the shot on a Sony A1 Mark II with a 70-200mm f/2.8 lens while hovering over the landscape in a helicopter, strapped into her seat with the door flung open.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;The photograph reflects the ecosystem of the Rift Valley soda lakes — highly alkaline environments where these birds thrive as the dominant species. They are called soda lakes because they contain exceptionally high concentrations of dissolved sodium carbonate and sodium bicarbonate, the same chemical compounds found in household baking soda and washing soda. &lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;These caustic waters would burn the skin of most other animals, but flamingos have evolved specific adaptations to turn this harsh landscape into a sanctuary. For instance, they have extra leathery, scaly skin on their legs to withstand chemical burns and specialized salt glands in their nasal cavity to filter out the excessive salt. It's an important breeding ground for these birds, Kirkland says, with an unusual landscape, like an entirely different world, with "painterly looking plumes of sediment under the surface of the lake."&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;"I've never seen anything like it," she says.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;"I think that when you're looking down, there's just so many different layers of beauty that you see from above that you could never see from the ground," she says.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kazakhstan: Alien Land&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-150684" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 6973;         --source-height: 10000;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6973x10000+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fae%2F3c%2F7f8534db4e7cb764d688471882b0%2Fnc-alien-land-isabella-tabacchi.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6973x10000+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fae%2F3c%2F7f8534db4e7cb764d688471882b0%2Fnc-alien-land-isabella-tabacchi.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6973x10000+0+0/resize/1000/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fae%2F3c%2F7f8534db4e7cb764d688471882b0%2Fnc-alien-land-isabella-tabacchi.jpg 1000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6973x10000+0+0/resize/1300/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fae%2F3c%2F7f8534db4e7cb764d688471882b0%2Fnc-alien-land-isabella-tabacchi.jpg 1300w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6973x10000+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fae%2F3c%2F7f8534db4e7cb764d688471882b0%2Fnc-alien-land-isabella-tabacchi.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6973x10000+0+0/resize/2000/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fae%2F3c%2F7f8534db4e7cb764d688471882b0%2Fnc-alien-land-isabella-tabacchi.jpg 2000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6973x10000+0+0/resize/2600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fae%2F3c%2F7f8534db4e7cb764d688471882b0%2Fnc-alien-land-isabella-tabacchi.jpg 2600w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6973x10000+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fae%2F3c%2F7f8534db4e7cb764d688471882b0%2Fnc-alien-land-isabella-tabacchi.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1300px) 1238px, (min-width: 1025px) calc(100vw - 60px), (min-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 60px), calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6973x10000+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fae%2F3c%2F7f8534db4e7cb764d688471882b0%2Fnc-alien-land-isabella-tabacchi.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6973x10000+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fae%2F3c%2F7f8534db4e7cb764d688471882b0%2Fnc-alien-land-isabella-tabacchi.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6973x10000+0+0/resize/1000/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fae%2F3c%2F7f8534db4e7cb764d688471882b0%2Fnc-alien-land-isabella-tabacchi.jpg 1000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6973x10000+0+0/resize/1300/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fae%2F3c%2F7f8534db4e7cb764d688471882b0%2Fnc-alien-land-isabella-tabacchi.jpg 1300w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6973x10000+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fae%2F3c%2F7f8534db4e7cb764d688471882b0%2Fnc-alien-land-isabella-tabacchi.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6973x10000+0+0/resize/2000/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fae%2F3c%2F7f8534db4e7cb764d688471882b0%2Fnc-alien-land-isabella-tabacchi.jpg 2000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6973x10000+0+0/resize/2600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fae%2F3c%2F7f8534db4e7cb764d688471882b0%2Fnc-alien-land-isabella-tabacchi.jpg 2600w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6973x10000+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fae%2F3c%2F7f8534db4e7cb764d688471882b0%2Fnc-alien-land-isabella-tabacchi.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1300px) 1238px, (min-width: 1025px) calc(100vw - 60px), (min-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 60px), calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6973x10000+0+0/resize/1100/quality/50/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fae%2F3c%2F7f8534db4e7cb764d688471882b0%2Fnc-alien-land-isabella-tabacchi.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6973x10000+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fae%2F3c%2F7f8534db4e7cb764d688471882b0%2Fnc-alien-land-isabella-tabacchi.jpg" class="img" alt="default" loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Millions of years of sediment deposition, tectonic activity and erosion created this formation in Mangystau. The geologic patterns are illuminated by the last light of day.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          &lt;a   href="https://droneawards.photo/profile/26858/isabella-tabacchi" class="Link"  target="_blank"   &gt;Isabella Tabacchi&lt;/a&gt;                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;Another highly commended photo in the Nature category by Italy-based photographer &lt;a href="https://www.isabellatabacchi.com/" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Isabella Tabacchi&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, the &lt;em&gt;Alien Land&lt;/em&gt; depicts the layers and patterns of deposited sediments, tectonic movements and erosion over millions of years — natural geological formations in Mangystau, Kazakhstan. &lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;"My fascination with Kazakhstan began in a rather unexpected way," says Tabacchi. "I was flying from Tokyo to Rome when our plane encountered considerable turbulence while crossing Kazakhstan. I remember becoming curious about the vast country beneath us. In my imagination, it seemed like a land of remote, mysterious places, still waiting to be explored."&lt;/p&gt;       &lt;p&gt;In 2024, she traveled there for the first time. The formation featured in &lt;em&gt;Alien Land&lt;/em&gt;, which she nicknamed Jellyfish (their branching patterns reminded her of a jellyfish swimming through water), was the result of extensive research rather than a chance encounter. &lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;"I spent countless hours studying satellite imagery, searching for unusual geological shapes and patterns in the Mangystau desert," she says. "Together with my guide and best friend Sav, I then explored the region in a Toyota Land Cruiser 4x4, trying to locate these formations on the ground. It was an extraordinary experience, turning shapes I'd discovered on a screen into real landscapes that I could finally photograph." &lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;Mangystau is one of the strangest, wildest, and most mysterious places Tabacchi has ever visited. "There's something about its immense, almost empty landscapes that makes me feel completely isolated from the rest of the world, as though I'm standing at the edge of infinity," she says. "It's a feeling I find difficult to experience anywhere else: a mixture of solitude, freedom and wonder."&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cox's Bazar, Bangladesh: &lt;/strong&gt;Rohingya Life Between Aid and Uncertainty&lt;/h3&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-150687" class="bucketwrap image x-large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 4096;         --source-height: 3072;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4096x3072+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F3a%2F2a%2Fe6011ca1476e9ef0350c8c74d156%2Fnc-rohingya-life-between-aid-and-uncertainty-shahedul-islam-sadik.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4096x3072+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F3a%2F2a%2Fe6011ca1476e9ef0350c8c74d156%2Fnc-rohingya-life-between-aid-and-uncertainty-shahedul-islam-sadik.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4096x3072+0+0/resize/1000/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F3a%2F2a%2Fe6011ca1476e9ef0350c8c74d156%2Fnc-rohingya-life-between-aid-and-uncertainty-shahedul-islam-sadik.jpg 1000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4096x3072+0+0/resize/1300/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F3a%2F2a%2Fe6011ca1476e9ef0350c8c74d156%2Fnc-rohingya-life-between-aid-and-uncertainty-shahedul-islam-sadik.jpg 1300w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4096x3072+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F3a%2F2a%2Fe6011ca1476e9ef0350c8c74d156%2Fnc-rohingya-life-between-aid-and-uncertainty-shahedul-islam-sadik.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4096x3072+0+0/resize/2000/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F3a%2F2a%2Fe6011ca1476e9ef0350c8c74d156%2Fnc-rohingya-life-between-aid-and-uncertainty-shahedul-islam-sadik.jpg 2000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4096x3072+0+0/resize/2600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F3a%2F2a%2Fe6011ca1476e9ef0350c8c74d156%2Fnc-rohingya-life-between-aid-and-uncertainty-shahedul-islam-sadik.jpg 2600w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4096x3072+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F3a%2F2a%2Fe6011ca1476e9ef0350c8c74d156%2Fnc-rohingya-life-between-aid-and-uncertainty-shahedul-islam-sadik.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1300px) 1238px, (min-width: 1025px) calc(100vw - 60px), (min-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 60px), calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4096x3072+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F3a%2F2a%2Fe6011ca1476e9ef0350c8c74d156%2Fnc-rohingya-life-between-aid-and-uncertainty-shahedul-islam-sadik.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4096x3072+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F3a%2F2a%2Fe6011ca1476e9ef0350c8c74d156%2Fnc-rohingya-life-between-aid-and-uncertainty-shahedul-islam-sadik.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4096x3072+0+0/resize/1000/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F3a%2F2a%2Fe6011ca1476e9ef0350c8c74d156%2Fnc-rohingya-life-between-aid-and-uncertainty-shahedul-islam-sadik.jpg 1000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4096x3072+0+0/resize/1300/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F3a%2F2a%2Fe6011ca1476e9ef0350c8c74d156%2Fnc-rohingya-life-between-aid-and-uncertainty-shahedul-islam-sadik.jpg 1300w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4096x3072+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F3a%2F2a%2Fe6011ca1476e9ef0350c8c74d156%2Fnc-rohingya-life-between-aid-and-uncertainty-shahedul-islam-sadik.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4096x3072+0+0/resize/2000/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F3a%2F2a%2Fe6011ca1476e9ef0350c8c74d156%2Fnc-rohingya-life-between-aid-and-uncertainty-shahedul-islam-sadik.jpg 2000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4096x3072+0+0/resize/2600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F3a%2F2a%2Fe6011ca1476e9ef0350c8c74d156%2Fnc-rohingya-life-between-aid-and-uncertainty-shahedul-islam-sadik.jpg 2600w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4096x3072+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F3a%2F2a%2Fe6011ca1476e9ef0350c8c74d156%2Fnc-rohingya-life-between-aid-and-uncertainty-shahedul-islam-sadik.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1300px) 1238px, (min-width: 1025px) calc(100vw - 60px), (min-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 60px), calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4096x3072+0+0/resize/1100/quality/50/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F3a%2F2a%2Fe6011ca1476e9ef0350c8c74d156%2Fnc-rohingya-life-between-aid-and-uncertainty-shahedul-islam-sadik.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4096x3072+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F3a%2F2a%2Fe6011ca1476e9ef0350c8c74d156%2Fnc-rohingya-life-between-aid-and-uncertainty-shahedul-islam-sadik.jpg" class="img" alt="default" loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 The Rohingya settlement in Bangladesh from above shows the overcrowded camps where these displaced people now live.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Shahedul Islam Sadik                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.unrefugees.org/news/rohingya-refugee-crisis-explained/" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;u&gt;More than 1 million Rohingya refugees&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt; currently live in Bangladesh, primarily concentrated in congested camps around Cox's Bazar. &lt;a href="https://oneeyeland.com/gallery/363696/courtship-display-md-shahedul-islam-sadik" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Shahedul Islam Sadik&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, a student at the Faculty of Fine Arts, University of Rajshahi in Bangladesh, says he has always wanted to tell their stories.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;His drone shot of the settlements was commended in the Urban category . "I wanted to document how a humanitarian crisis had reshaped not only the lives of displaced people, but also [show] the natural and geographical landscape of their place of refuge. The photograph is therefore about more than population density; it also captures the visible consequences of a prolonged crisis," he says.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;Sadik was struck by how densely populated and congested the settlements are. "What stayed with me most, however, was the sense that receiving assistance does not necessarily mean having the life one wants," he says. "Life in the settlements can feel confined, without the freedom they once had in their homeland."&lt;/p&gt;       &lt;p&gt;He wanted viewers to notice not only the lack of physical space but also what it represents in the refugees' lives. "For me, the drone photograph captures more than overcrowding; it reflects a lack of personal space, freedom and room to breathe, both literally and figuratively," he says.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bangladesh: &lt;/strong&gt;Ferry boats, Dhaka&lt;/h3&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-150686" class="bucketwrap image x-large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 7883;         --source-height: 5250;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7883x5250+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F01%2F76%2Fd62dd52b42dc8ddfc70641f928a0%2Fnc-ferry-boats-dhaka-george-steinmetz.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7883x5250+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F01%2F76%2Fd62dd52b42dc8ddfc70641f928a0%2Fnc-ferry-boats-dhaka-george-steinmetz.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7883x5250+0+0/resize/1000/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F01%2F76%2Fd62dd52b42dc8ddfc70641f928a0%2Fnc-ferry-boats-dhaka-george-steinmetz.jpg 1000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7883x5250+0+0/resize/1300/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F01%2F76%2Fd62dd52b42dc8ddfc70641f928a0%2Fnc-ferry-boats-dhaka-george-steinmetz.jpg 1300w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7883x5250+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F01%2F76%2Fd62dd52b42dc8ddfc70641f928a0%2Fnc-ferry-boats-dhaka-george-steinmetz.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7883x5250+0+0/resize/2000/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F01%2F76%2Fd62dd52b42dc8ddfc70641f928a0%2Fnc-ferry-boats-dhaka-george-steinmetz.jpg 2000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7883x5250+0+0/resize/2600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F01%2F76%2Fd62dd52b42dc8ddfc70641f928a0%2Fnc-ferry-boats-dhaka-george-steinmetz.jpg 2600w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7883x5250+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F01%2F76%2Fd62dd52b42dc8ddfc70641f928a0%2Fnc-ferry-boats-dhaka-george-steinmetz.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1300px) 1238px, (min-width: 1025px) calc(100vw - 60px), (min-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 60px), calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7883x5250+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F01%2F76%2Fd62dd52b42dc8ddfc70641f928a0%2Fnc-ferry-boats-dhaka-george-steinmetz.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7883x5250+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F01%2F76%2Fd62dd52b42dc8ddfc70641f928a0%2Fnc-ferry-boats-dhaka-george-steinmetz.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7883x5250+0+0/resize/1000/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F01%2F76%2Fd62dd52b42dc8ddfc70641f928a0%2Fnc-ferry-boats-dhaka-george-steinmetz.jpg 1000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7883x5250+0+0/resize/1300/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F01%2F76%2Fd62dd52b42dc8ddfc70641f928a0%2Fnc-ferry-boats-dhaka-george-steinmetz.jpg 1300w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7883x5250+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F01%2F76%2Fd62dd52b42dc8ddfc70641f928a0%2Fnc-ferry-boats-dhaka-george-steinmetz.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7883x5250+0+0/resize/2000/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F01%2F76%2Fd62dd52b42dc8ddfc70641f928a0%2Fnc-ferry-boats-dhaka-george-steinmetz.jpg 2000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7883x5250+0+0/resize/2600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F01%2F76%2Fd62dd52b42dc8ddfc70641f928a0%2Fnc-ferry-boats-dhaka-george-steinmetz.jpg 2600w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7883x5250+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F01%2F76%2Fd62dd52b42dc8ddfc70641f928a0%2Fnc-ferry-boats-dhaka-george-steinmetz.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1300px) 1238px, (min-width: 1025px) calc(100vw - 60px), (min-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 60px), calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7883x5250+0+0/resize/1100/quality/50/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F01%2F76%2Fd62dd52b42dc8ddfc70641f928a0%2Fnc-ferry-boats-dhaka-george-steinmetz.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/7883x5250+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F01%2F76%2Fd62dd52b42dc8ddfc70641f928a0%2Fnc-ferry-boats-dhaka-george-steinmetz.jpg" class="img" alt="A crowd of homebound passengers is seen heading south from the Sadarghat Launch Terminal before the start of the Eid al-Fitr holiday on March 18, 2026. Although a new bridge was recently built across the Padma River, the rivers are still major passenger transportation routes. Due to rapid urbanization, the majority of people in Dhaka were born in rural areas, and go to their ancestral home for the weeklong holiday. Nearly 10 million people across the country have begun leaving cities to celebrate the festival with their families, creating heavy congestion and a festive atmosphere at all transport hubs." loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Passengers on the ferry boats at the Sadarghat Launch Terminal before the start of the Eid al-Fitr holiday on March 18, 2026. Although a new bridge was recently built across the Padma River, the rivers are still major passenger transportation routes. Due to rapid urbanization, the majority of people in Dhaka were born in rural areas and go to their ancestral home for the weeklong holiday.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          George Steinmetz                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;A burst of color and celebration fills the waterways of Dhaka, Bangladesh, as thousands of people make their way home for Eid, one of the most important festivals in the Islamic calendar.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;Every year, the holiday triggers a massive exodus from the capital, as migrant workers and other residents travel to their hometowns to reunite with family. Ferries, packed with passengers and their belongings, become a vital means of transport.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;For photographer George Steinmetz, the scene offered a striking contrast to his photograph of Bangladesh's shipbreaking industry. This photo was commended in the Urban category. From above, the crowded boats, their brightly colored decks and passengers' festive clothing create a vibrant patchwork against the river.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;"I've never seen a ferry terminal like that," he says. Dhaka's Sadarghat Launch Terminal is widely recognized as &lt;a href="https://beautifulbangladesh.gov.bd/district-destination/dhaka/landmarks/115" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;u&gt;one of the largest and busiest river ports in the world&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, frequented by 50,000 people every day. &lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;"It's such a joyous scene," he says. "They have shopping bags full of gifts of food to bring to their families. When it's packed with people, I knew would be really epic. And again, it's like they look like ants."&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;Steinmetz captured the scene using a drone launched from the rooftop of a building overlooking the waterfront. But he almost missed the opportunity. The skies were overcast, and rain began falling shortly after his drone made the photograph. Had the rain started any earlier, he might have been unable to fly his drone.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;For Steinmetz, drones offer the freedom to explore a scene from different angles, searching for the perfect composition rather than settling for the first striking view.&lt;/p&gt;       &lt;p&gt;"I don't just want to get a picture. I want to get the best possible picture," he says.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Kamala Thiagarajan is a freelance journalist based in Madurai, South India. She reports on global health, science and development and has been published in &lt;/em&gt;The New York Times &lt;em&gt;, &lt;/em&gt;The British Medical Journal &lt;em&gt;, the BBC, &lt;/em&gt;The Guardian &lt;em&gt; and other outlets. You can find her on X: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://x.com/kamal_t?lang=en" target="_blank"&gt;@Kamal_t&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For stories about life in our changing world, &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/newsletter/goats-and-soda" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;em&gt;subscribe to NPR's Global Health newsletter.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
