      <title>Your writing was flagged as AI. What does that actually mean?</title>
      <author>Windsor Johnston</author>
      <link>https://www.npr.org/2026/10/31/nx-s1-5963520/ai-writing-detectors-pangram</link>
      <comments>https://text.npr.org/2026/10/31/nx-s1-5963520/ai-writing-detectors-pangram</comments>
