%2F45%2F0c%2Fd4b63b9247cc9f7c958c00c87f2f%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-06240-2.jpg 1800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1225x817+0+0/resize/2400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F45%2F0c%2Fd4b63b9247cc9f7c958c00c87f2f%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-06240-2.jpg 2400w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1225x817+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F45%2F0c%2Fd4b63b9247cc9f7c958c00c87f2f%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-06240-2.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1350px) 953px, (min-width: 1025px) calc(100vw - 395px), (min-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 60px), calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1225x817+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F45%2F0c%2Fd4b63b9247cc9f7c958c00c87f2f%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-06240-2.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1225x817+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F45%2F0c%2Fd4b63b9247cc9f7c958c00c87f2f%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-06240-2.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1225x817+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F45%2F0c%2Fd4b63b9247cc9f7c958c00c87f2f%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-06240-2.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1225x817+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F45%2F0c%2Fd4b63b9247cc9f7c958c00c87f2f%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-06240-2.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1225x817+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F45%2F0c%2Fd4b63b9247cc9f7c958c00c87f2f%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-06240-2.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1225x817+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F45%2F0c%2Fd4b63b9247cc9f7c958c00c87f2f%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-06240-2.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1225x817+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F45%2F0c%2Fd4b63b9247cc9f7c958c00c87f2f%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-06240-2.jpg 1800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1225x817+0+0/resize/2400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F45%2F0c%2Fd4b63b9247cc9f7c958c00c87f2f%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-06240-2.jpg 2400w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1225x817+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F45%2F0c%2Fd4b63b9247cc9f7c958c00c87f2f%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-06240-2.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1350px) 953px, (min-width: 1025px) calc(100vw - 395px), (min-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 60px), calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1225x817+0+0/resize/1100/quality/50/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F45%2F0c%2Fd4b63b9247cc9f7c958c00c87f2f%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-06240-2.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1225x817+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F45%2F0c%2Fd4b63b9247cc9f7c958c00c87f2f%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-06240-2.jpg" class="img" alt="Construction crews work on houses and other building throughout Kipnuk after ex-typhoon Halong hit Alaska&amp;#039;s coast in October of 2025." fetchpriority="high" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Construction crews work on houses and other building throughout Kipnuk after ex-typhoon Halong hit Alaska's coast in October of 2025.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Gabby Hiestand Salgado/KYUK                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2025/10/17/nx-s1-5577974/typhoon-halong-western-alaska-villages-damaged-yukon-kuskokwim-delta" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Last fall&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, the remnants of Typhoon Halong tore through &lt;a href="https://www.kyuk.org/public-safety/2025-11-15/what-we-know-about-recovery-a-month-after-ex-typhoon-halong" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;u&gt;numerous small Alaska Native villages&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt; off the road system in Western Alaska. The storm destroyed infrastructure, floated homes off their foundations, and displaced over a thousand people. A year later, &lt;a href="https://www.kyuk.org/public-safety/2026-10-12/halong-1-year-after-the-storm" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;u&gt;hundreds&lt;/u&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt; &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;remain displaced as the slow work of repair in a remote part of the state continues. And in one of the hardest hit communities – the small town of Kipnuk – people still aren't sure when they'll be moving back.&lt;/p&gt;       &lt;div id="resnx-s1-6021471-100" class="bucketwrap internallink insettwocolumn inset2col"&gt;                     &lt;!-- END CLASS="BUCKET IMG" --&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;     &lt;!-- END ID="RESNX-S1-6021471-100" CLASS="BUCKETWRAP INTERNALLINK INSETTWOCOLUMN INSET2COL " --&gt;    &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;'Working as fast as we can' &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;   &lt;p&gt;The village of under &lt;a href="https://data.census.gov/profile/Kipnuk_CDP,_Alaska?g=160XX00US0239740" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;u&gt;200 homes&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is situated on the wide open tundra and only consistently accessible by plane.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;A year ago, 90% of the residences here were damaged by the remnants of Typhoon Halong, according to the State of Alaska's Emergency Operations Center. Dozens were swept off their foundations, &lt;a href="https://alaskapublic.org/news/2025-10-13/51-people-rescued-and-at-least-3-still-missing-after-massive-storm-hits-western-alaska" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;u&gt;some with families still inside&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. The community is now largely scattered across Alaska – some outside the region their ancestors have lived in for thousands of years.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-150935" class="bucketwrap image x-large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 1475;         --source-height: 983;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1475x983+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb0%2Fec%2F37c541c749bd94829d836de382f9%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-0996.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1475x983+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb0%2Fec%2F37c541c749bd94829d836de382f9%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-0996.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1475x983+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb0%2Fec%2F37c541c749bd94829d836de382f9%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-0996.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1475x983+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb0%2Fec%2F37c541c749bd94829d836de382f9%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-0996.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1475x983+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb0%2Fec%2F37c541c749bd94829d836de382f9%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-0996.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1475x983+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb0%2Fec%2F37c541c749bd94829d836de382f9%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-0996.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1475x983+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb0%2Fec%2F37c541c749bd94829d836de382f9%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-0996.jpg 1800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1475x983+0+0/resize/2400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb0%2Fec%2F37c541c749bd94829d836de382f9%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-0996.jpg 2400w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1475x983+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb0%2Fec%2F37c541c749bd94829d836de382f9%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-0996.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1350px) 953px, (min-width: 1025px) calc(100vw - 395px), (min-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 60px), calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1475x983+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb0%2Fec%2F37c541c749bd94829d836de382f9%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-0996.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1475x983+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb0%2Fec%2F37c541c749bd94829d836de382f9%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-0996.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1475x983+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb0%2Fec%2F37c541c749bd94829d836de382f9%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-0996.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1475x983+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb0%2Fec%2F37c541c749bd94829d836de382f9%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-0996.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1475x983+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb0%2Fec%2F37c541c749bd94829d836de382f9%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-0996.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1475x983+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb0%2Fec%2F37c541c749bd94829d836de382f9%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-0996.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1475x983+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb0%2Fec%2F37c541c749bd94829d836de382f9%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-0996.jpg 1800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1475x983+0+0/resize/2400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb0%2Fec%2F37c541c749bd94829d836de382f9%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-0996.jpg 2400w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1475x983+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb0%2Fec%2F37c541c749bd94829d836de382f9%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-0996.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1350px) 953px, (min-width: 1025px) calc(100vw - 395px), (min-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 60px), calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1475x983+0+0/resize/1100/quality/50/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb0%2Fec%2F37c541c749bd94829d836de382f9%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-0996.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1475x983+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb0%2Fec%2F37c541c749bd94829d836de382f9%2F260811-gsalgado-kipnuk-0996.jpg" class="img" alt="Kipnuk ten months after ex-typhoon Halong hit Alaska&amp;#039;s coast in October of 2025." loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Kipnuk 10 months after ex-typhoon Halong hit Alaska's coast in October of 2025.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Gabby Hiestand Salgado/KYUK                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;Throughout the past year, crews have been working on repairs.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;On a clear day in August, Eddie Chuckwuk's construction crew attempted what sounded like magic: raising a building back onto its foundations using air compressors.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div id="resnx-s1-6021471-101" class="bucketwrap internallink insettwocolumn inset2col"&gt;                     &lt;!-- END CLASS="BUCKET IMG" --&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;     &lt;!-- END ID="RESNX-S1-6021471-101" CLASS="BUCKETWRAP INTERNALLINK INSETTWOCOLUMN INSET2COL " --&gt;    &lt;p&gt;Chuckwuk is one of several dozen people who have been working long days to rebuild the place where he grew up.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;"&lt;/em&gt;We're working as fast as possible as we can to get the people back in town," Chuckwuk says. "That's what I just want to see – for everybody to come back and enjoy where they grew up instead of being placed in a different place … where they're not used to. It's pretty hard."&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-150943" class="bucketwrap image x-large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 1600;         --source-height: 539;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1600x539+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F07%2F29%2Fcf185dbe4a469359a44abcb0ecf0%2Fak-flooding-4.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1600x539+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F07%2F29%2Fcf185dbe4a469359a44abcb0ecf0%2Fak-flooding-4.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1600x539+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F07%2F29%2Fcf185dbe4a469359a44abcb0ecf0%2Fak-flooding-4.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1600x539+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F07%2F29%2Fcf185dbe4a469359a44abcb0ecf0%2Fak-flooding-4.jpg 900w, http